         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline>
                  <pb facs="HS00048772X_0086"/>
                  <date>18. 7. 911</date>
               </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>herzlicher Gruſs! Wir ſind noch
      hier, ich hole <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04389-1"/>am <date>30. 7.</date>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04389-1">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-tagebuch" target="1911-07-31" subtype="Cf"/>.</note>
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1"/>
               <rs type="person" ref="#pmb12701" subtype="implied">Mama</rs> 
               aus <rs type="place" ref="#pmb867">I<c rendition="#gemination-n"/>sbruck</rs> ab – nach
      <rs type="place" ref="#pmb662">Baden</rs> oder <hi rend="latintype">
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb415">Aussee</rs>
               </hi> – eventuell
      gehn wir alle auf den <rs type="place" ref="#pmb189">Se<c rendition="#gemination-m"/>ering</rs>.
      Vorläufg nichts ſichres. Aber ich
      find es hier, in <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>, ſehr
      ſchön.</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>Ihr A.</signed>
               <lb/>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb2173"/>Olga</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
